@startuml CDA-543-Error-Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Error Propagation Flow - CDA Issue #543

participant "load_single_mdd" as LSM
participant "load_ecu_from_file" as LEF
participant "build_diagnostic_database" as BDD
participant "resolve_com_params" as RCP
participant "create_ecu_manager" as CEM

== Happy Path ==

LSM -> LEF: call with proto_data, ctx
activate LEF

LEF -> BDD: build database
activate BDD
BDD --> LEF: Ok(DiagnosticDatabase)
deactivate BDD

LEF -> RCP: resolve params
activate RCP
RCP --> LEF: Some(ComParams)
deactivate RCP

LEF -> CEM: create manager
activate CEM
CEM --> LEF: Ok(EcuManager)
deactivate CEM

LEF --> LSM: Ok(EcuLoadResult)
deactivate LEF

== Error: Missing Payload ==

LSM -> LEF: call with empty proto_data
activate LEF

LEF -> BDD: build database
activate BDD
BDD --> LEF: **Err(MissingPayload)**
deactivate BDD

LEF --> LSM: **Err(MissingPayload)**
deactivate LEF

note right of LSM: Error propagated via ? operator

== Error: Invalid ComParams ==

LSM -> LEF: call with proto_data
activate LEF

LEF -> BDD: build database
BDD --> LEF: Ok(DiagnosticDatabase)

LEF -> RCP: resolve params
activate RCP
RCP --> LEF: None
deactivate RCP

LEF --> LSM: **Err(ComParamsInvalid)**
deactivate LEF

note right of LSM: ok_or_else converts Option to Result

== Error: ECU Manager Creation Failed ==

LSM -> LEF: call with proto_data
activate LEF

LEF -> BDD: build database
BDD --> LEF: Ok(DiagnosticDatabase)

LEF -> RCP: resolve params
RCP --> LEF: Some(ComParams)

LEF -> CEM: create manager
activate CEM
CEM --> LEF: **Err(EcuManagerFailed)**
deactivate CEM

LEF --> LSM: **Err(EcuManagerFailed)**
deactivate LEF

@enduml
